{
  "title": "Performance FX",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Getting Started",
      "lines": [
        "32 punch-in audio FX.",
        "Hold a pad and the FX",
        "is on; release and it",
        "is off. Press harder",
        "for more.",
        "",
        "LAUNCH",
        " Shift+Vol+Jog Click,",
        " then pick",
        " Performance FX.",
        "",
        "TRY IT",
        "1 Play something on",
        "  the Move",
        "2 Hold any pad and",
        "  listen",
        "3 Press harder for",
        "  more effect",
        "4 Shift+hold to latch",
        "  it on",
        "5 Turn knobs to tweak",
        "6 Back to exit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pad Layout",
      "lines": [
        "All 32 pads are",
        "punch-in. Hold is on,",
        "release is off, and",
        "pressure drives the",
        "effect.",
        "",
        "Row 4, orange: Time",
        " 1/4  1/8  1/16 Trip",
        " Stut Scat Rev  Strch",
        "",
        "Row 3, blue: Filters",
        " LP   HP   BPup BPdn",
        " Reso Phas Flan Auto",
        "",
        "Row 2, purple: Space",
        " Dly  DlyD PP   PPD",
        " Room Hall Dark Sprg",
        "",
        "Row 1, mixed: Distort",
        " Crsh Down Sat  Gate",
        " Trem Oct  Vnyl VnBk"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Latching",
      "lines": [
        "Any FX can be latched",
        "so it stays on after",
        "you let go.",
        "",
        "LATCH",
        " Shift + hold the pad.",
        " It turns red.",
        "",
        "UNLATCH",
        " Shift + hold that",
        " same pad again.",
        "",
        "You can also hold a",
        "pad and then press",
        "Shift to toggle it.",
        "",
        "Tap a latched pad to",
        "select it for E4-E6",
        "editing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Knobs",
      "lines": [
        "Touch any knob to see",
        "what it controls.",
        "",
        "E1 Repeat Length",
        "E2 Repeat Speed",
        "   centre is normal",
        "E3 Repeat Loop",
        "   right on, left off",
        "",
        "E4 Per-FX param 1",
        "E5 Per-FX param 2",
        "E6 Per-FX param 3",
        "   for the pad you",
        "   last touched",
        "",
        "E7 Tilt EQ",
        "E8 DJ Filter",
        "Shift+E8 Dry/Wet",
        "",
        "The volume knob is",
        "always the host",
        "volume - it is never",
        "captured."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Per-FX Params",
      "lines": [
        "Tap a pad to select",
        "it, then use E4, E5",
        "and E6. The screen",
        "always shows that",
        "pad's own three",
        "labels.",
        "",
        "E6 IS A WET AMOUNT",
        "ONLY WHERE BLENDING",
        "IS A REAL TECHNIQUE -",
        "sends and parallel",
        "processing. Time-based",
        "FX get Decay or Depth",
        "instead, because",
        "mixing a delayed copy",
        "back in just comb-",
        "filters it.",
        "",
        "Repeats",
        " Filter Gate Dcy",
        "Scatter",
        " Pattrn Gate Rev",
        "Reverse",
        " Length Filt Dcy",
        "Stretch",
        " Speed Filter -",
        "",
        "Sweeps",
        " Speed Reso Dpth",
        "Reso Sweep",
        " Speed Reso Mix",
        "Phaser",
        " Depth Fdbk Mix",
        "Flanger",
        " Depth Fdbk Mix",
        "AutoFilter",
        " Depth Reso Cntr",
        "",
        "Delays",
        " Fdbk Tone Level",
        "Reverbs",
        " Decay Tone Lvl",
        "",
        "Crush",
        " Bits Tone Mix",
        "Downsample",
        " Rate Tone Mix",
        "Saturate",
        " Drive Tone Mix",
        "Gate",
        " Rate Duty Depth",
        "Tremolo",
        " Rate Depth Shpe",
        "Oct Down",
        " Pitch Tone Mix",
        "Vinyl",
        " Noise Warmth Mx",
        "Vinyl Brake",
        " Rate Noise Tone"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pressure",
      "lines": [
        "The knobs set the",
        "base value; pressure",
        "pushes it either side",
        "of that. A neutral",
        "finger leaves the",
        "knob position alone.",
        "",
        "What pressure moves:",
        "",
        "Repeats  loop volume",
        "Sweeps   cutoff",
        "AutoFlt  sweep speed",
        "Phaser   LFO speed",
        "Flanger  LFO speed",
        "Delay    feedback",
        "Reverb   decay length",
        "Crush    bit depth",
        "Saturate drive",
        "Gate     duty cycle",
        "Tremolo  LFO rate",
        "Stretch  how slow",
        "VnlBrk   spindown"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Bypass",
      "lines": [
        "The Undo button is",
        "Bypass.",
        "",
        "Hold it for a",
        "momentary bypass - it",
        "resumes when you let",
        "go. There is no",
        "latched bypass: a tap",
        "is just a very short",
        "hold.",
        "",
        "While bypassed the",
        "audio passes through",
        "dry. Every FX keeps",
        "its current state and",
        "is only silenced, so",
        "turning bypass off",
        "picks up where you",
        "were."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Tempo",
      "lines": [
        "Jog click",
        " tap tempo. Tap it",
        " two or more times.",
        "",
        "Jog turn",
        " coarse BPM, 1 at a",
        " time",
        "",
        "Shift + jog turn",
        " fine BPM, 0.5 at a",
        " time",
        "",
        "Range is 20 to 300",
        "BPM.",
        "",
        "Back exits",
        "Performance FX."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Tips",
      "lines": [
        "Press harder for",
        "more. Each FX answers",
        "to pressure",
        "differently.",
        "",
        "Latch several FX at",
        "once for layered",
        "sound design.",
        "",
        "Filter sweeps animate",
        "while you hold them -",
        "try LP.",
        "",
        "The Space FX on row 2",
        "have a natural tail",
        "that decays after you",
        "release.",
        "",
        "Repeat rate knob",
        "changes take effect",
        "immediately.",
        "",
        "Tap latched pads to",
        "select them for knob",
        "tweaks."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
